#env MBUI_WIN=1280x800
# The wide frame (a desktop's window, src/sfapp/wide.mbt): the test chat pressed in the sidebar's list opens beside
# it; words typed in its composer, sent; the bubble, then sent.
timeout 60000
until 新建对话
until 端到端测试
tap 端到端测试
until 发消息
wait 800
shot 1-open
tap 发消息
type 宽屏里发出的消息 {T}
shot 2-typed
tap icon:arrow-up
until 宽屏里发出的消息 {T}
gone 正在发送
shot 3-sent
